      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corrales%2C_New_Mexico",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Corrales hosts the annual Corrales Garden Tour, a sustainable growing event that raised funds to restore the historic Old Church.",
